<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: TENNIS-CZECH OPEN SECOND ROUND RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-CZECH OPEN SECOND ROUND RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1997-05-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Second round results in the</p>
<p>$365,000 Czech Open men's tennis tournament on Thursday (prefix</p>
<p>number denotes seeding):</p>
<p>Marcello Craca (Germany) beat 1-Yevgeny Kafelnikov (Russia) 7-6</p>
<p>(7-4) 6-4</p>
<p>2-Marcelo Rios (Chile) beat Stephan Simian (France) 6-4 6-2</p>
<p>Emilio Alvarez (Spain) beat Carlos Costa (Spain) 7-5 4-6 6-4</p>
<p>Fabrice Santoro (France) beat Gustavo Kurten (Brazil)</p>
<p>7-6 (7-4) 3-6 6-1</p>
</text>
